<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = 5.11%				    O/N = 5.10%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 7.66%				    T/N = 2.55%</p>
<p>		   Sept 17, 1996			Sept 13, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  8.85%	1 month forward =  8.84%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  9.70%	2 month forward =  9.86%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  9.99%	3 month forward = 10.09%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward = 10.56%	4 month forward = 10.80%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 10.69%	5 month forward = 11.02%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.52%	6 month forward = 10.79%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
